<p>Orcs have seen countless battles, and won many of them.</p><p>You revel in the defeat of your foes, gaining <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Constitution 100">9%, 10%, 11%, 12%, 13%</acronym> damage resistance for 2 turns each time you kill an enemy.</p><p>The resistance will scale with talent level and your Constitution.</p><p>Additionally, passively increase all damage penetration by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6%, 10%, 12%, 13%, 15%.</acronym></p>